# Dam+ B presses through the real input path (tests/damplus/buttons.sh): the player bot walks Bond up to each Dam+ console and
# presses B there on player 1's pad (`use obj T`: walk up, face it, B three times). Plan language: modding/bot.md.
# The long legs between are scripted warps (tests only) to a pad in the console's room some way off, so the last stretch is
# walked: the pier from 400 back along the quay, the valve from 300 along the balcony.
# Tags: 22 the launch call box on the west pier, 23 the one on the island quay, 21 the spillway valve station (port_damplus.h / .c).
# Agent: the bungee is the only objective, so the run ends at the platform.
name dpbuttons
peace 1
warp obj 22 400
use obj 22
wait 240
use obj 23
wait 240
warp obj 21 300
use obj 21
wait 240
warp pad 330
goto pad 330 30
exit
